@startuml
title MeowMed (Version P) - Schedule Proposal State Machine

[*] --> Drafting : propose_schedule(drugs)

Drafting --> Refused : unknown drug [FR-04, GR-01]
Drafting --> Blocked : HIGH interaction detected [FR-03]
Drafting --> PendingApproval : safety checks passed

PendingApproval --> Approved : patient clicks Approve [GR-04]
PendingApproval --> Rejected : patient rejects or timeout

Approved --> Saved : save_schedule() via patient-db MCP [FR-02]

Refused --> [*]
Blocked --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Saved --> [*]

note right of PendingApproval
  Approval gate (GR-04):
  The AI may propose a schedule,
  only the patient can approve it.
end note

note right of Blocked
  Safety rule (FR-03):
  High-risk drug combinations
  can never be approved or saved.
end note
@enduml
